WEBVTT

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.460
Let's see.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:09.690
At 11, she became the first among mankind to possess a holy spirit.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.740
It allows you stay young forever, right?

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:17.370
Just your body. The soul still ages, Prince.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.240
Is that true, Renbo?

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.140
Renbokoji, sir.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.600
That's way too long.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.880
Your lady godmother is a Renbokoji as well.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.680
You're not her, though.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:33.260
Say, how old were they when they got the blessing?

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.840
"Blessing"?

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:42.230
We called it a curse at the time.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.380
This is Gustav Ein.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.240
We have located the point of impact of the JIORian vessel.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.380
It is badly damaged.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:29.360
No signs of the Valvraves or passengers.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.420
I repeat.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.970
The vessel is badly damaged.

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:34.260
No signs of the Valvraves or passengers.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:41.200
The ground forces present at the site are securing the location as we speak.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.760
They are using Rollers for the search, without success so far.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.540
These are Valvraves.

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.390
Regional troops will be vastly outclassed.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:53.440
We may be on Earth now, but we are space forces.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.250
We don't have the jurisdiction—

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.990
I'm well aware of where we stand.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:00.530
We'll simply offer a few helpful suggestions.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:01.790
But—

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:02.970
Is there a problem?

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:04.540
No, sir.

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:09.370
They sure picked an interesting spot to crash.

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:14.240
Is all of Dorssia this deserted?

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:16.830
We just happened to crash in the countryside.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.560
We're lucky there's no snow.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:22.930
I can't believe all it took was a 0.2 degree deviation.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:27.510
We're done for! We landed right in the middle of enemy territory!

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:31.690
So what? We were gonna kick their asses anyway!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:35.190
I see someone still lacks the brainpower to comprehend the phrase, "demonstration of power".

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.350
What you say?!

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.900
When will you finally learn?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.790
We fell in the middle of the enemy territory!

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.950
Ain't got no choice but to fight!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.140
Reasoning of a gorilla.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:44.350
Cut it out!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.570
We can't afford to fight each other now.

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:51.540
We have to figure out how to get to JIOR from here.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:54.450
You got any idea how far it is?

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.040
Or like, any ideas at all?

00:03:56.550 --> 00:04:00.420
L-Elf's thinking of something. I hope.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.320
Him again?

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.930
He's one of us now!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.930
His plans already took us this far!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:07.930
Was I just seeing things? But...

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.670
The blood was still there too.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.150
Yeah, but still...

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:20.830
I trust L-Elf.

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.970
We need him.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:24.720
Let me tell you the plan.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:29.160
The goal is to secure a means of transport.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.300
Yeah, we abandoned our ship.

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:33.660
Where we gonna get that?

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.040
From the Dorssian army.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.430
From the enemy?

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:39.760
Well sure, an army vehicle should be able to carry the Valvraves, but still...

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.170
Sounds terribly difficult.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:45.930
But they're way better than that civilian crap. If we can get one, that is.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.750
You make it sound simple, but how do we do that?

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:51.610
We'll send spies to infiltrate the enemy.

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:54.810
The team will be comprised of Rukino Saki and Renbokoji Akira.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.210
A-Akira?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.150
Me? Outside?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:07.340
Renbokoji Akira. We need your skills.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.170
I object!

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:10.810
You can't send in Akira!

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:11.910
Stop being mean to her!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:14.040
But sending me's fine?

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:17.520
Well, you're...

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.000
Yeah, you're...

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:19.540
Uh.

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:21.460
Maybe if you were a little cuter.

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.040
Why Akira?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:29.310
Because no one else has the skills to handle this mission.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:30.040
Come on out!

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:32.210
Like hell! Akira can't—

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.080
I'll go.

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:34.520
Akira?

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.520
I'll do my best.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.740
I'm happy you want to go so far for me,

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:43.900
but you don't have to overdo it.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.410
Shoko.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.890
You think the Dorssians will fall for it?

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:04.120
Well...

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:08.180
We just took a bunch of spare parts and made them look like a Valvrave.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.470
It'll be fine.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.360
L-Elf said we only need to sow the seeds of doubt.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.190
The goal is to buy some time.

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:15.880
I see...

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.120
Sashinami!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.850
The ARUS diplomats called!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.060
The ARUS? Not Dorssia?

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:27.070
Yeah! The five Valvraves landed on Dorssian territory instead of in the ARUS!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.750
No way...

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:39.450
Word from JIOR: they want to know where their team crashed.

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:43.130
It would appear that they have no means to communicate with the Valvraves either.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.490
Even though the new Valvrave we located on Module 77

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:51.080
fits the appearance and measurements the Figaro report mentioned,

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.520
it is likely a fake.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:57.020
Let's pretend to take the bait.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:05.360
We can use the existence of further Valvraves on Module 77 to pressure Dorssia.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:06.750
You're right.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:10.740
We could leak it to the media, then we'd only have to confirm it.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.900
I'll get the material ready right away.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:18.580
The Counsel of the Hundred and One... The Magius...

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.530
Who knows what they're planning?

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:31.800
Sorry for the wait.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.020
Huh? Where is she?

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.540
Are we really taking her with us?

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.440
We're running out of time. Let's go.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:43.730
This way?

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:46.480
I know this leads to the surface.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:48.040
You know?

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.240
You've been here before?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:53.370
Yeah. This is where I was made.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.420
Double-check your positions.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:59.850
Everyone remembers L-Elf's plan?

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:01.370
The bombs go a bit further in.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:03.370
It's real...

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.360
Don't worry. It won't explode that easily.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:07.380
Define "easily".

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.010
I can make it go off at any time, though.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.130
So will it explode or not?

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:14.340
I see.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:16.890
He sure is cautious.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.230
Sorry, could you hold this screwdriver for me?

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.860
You don't have to hold my hand, too.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:38.280
I was pleasantly surprised when you decided to come along.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:44.120
L-Elf told me you requested a spot.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:52.100
I just... hoped I'd remember something if I came to Earth.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:53.050
Remember what?

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:58.240
I heard that this plan was your idea.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:00.520
What made you think of coming down to Earth?

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:06.810
There are lots of things I need to figure out.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:09.360
You mean besides JIOR's situation?

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:13.850
About the Valvraves and the reason behind this whole war.

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:18.000
And about myself too.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.080
Haru—

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.170
Tokishima! We got you some food!

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.820
Like my grandma used to say, you can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:29.820
I bow before the wisdom of our elders.

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:30.800
I know, right?

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.760
There's still curry-flavor left.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.360
Can I really have it?

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:35.630
Sure thing!

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.450
I'm impressed you found this path, Q-Vier.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:55.400
Not bad, for a midget.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.780
Hey, X, can I shoot him?

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:59.530
Put that thing away, damn it!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.160
Q-Vier, permission granted.

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.570
Permission acknowledged!

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:03.800
Cut it out!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:04.730
Q-Vier!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.210
A gunshot would echo here. Use a knife.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.710
Oh come on!

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.850
Roger! A knife it is!

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:13.440
Whoa, you actually took it out?!

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.460
Am I also permitted to do so?

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.600
Seriously now, stop that!

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:31.200
Is this a village?

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:32.060
Yeah.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.050
Time has passed, but nothing's changed.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:38.040
I can't believe people live here.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.370
What's that?

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:47.120
The pride of the Dorssian ground forces, the mobile base Idealblume.

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:50.880
It comes down straight into the enemy lines, creating a bridgehead.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.380
It's the revolutionary weapon that made the Third Blitzkrieg possible.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:57.420
This is what took over JIOR?

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:58.360
That's right.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.180
Um...

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.730
How do you say, "Hello"?

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:19.160
Really, nothing's changed.

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.410
You're from the Karlstein facility, aren't you?

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:27.410
Two, huh? Perfect.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.620
<i>The Karlstein facility.</i>

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.310
<i>It appears to be an ordinary village,</i>

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:45.350
<i>but it's actually a top secret facility where army agents are raised.</i>

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.350
<i>They told us to kill any and all intruders.</i>

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:51.600
<i>Kill traitors. Kill deserters.</i>

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.110
<i>Kill witnesses.</i>

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:56.110
<i>Kill. Kill. Kill.</i>

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:20.460
I'm fine. Don't come out.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.990
B-But... But you're bleeding...

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:24.890
I told you that I'm fine.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:38.020
<i>It was kill or be killed.</i>

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:47.440
Did you forget what we told you on the Moon?

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:51.400
Those who possess the holy spirit are immortal.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:53.980
Our wounds heal right away.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.780
Really?

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.540
Really.

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:01.420
H-Here.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.180
Thanks...

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:09.620
Can you move?

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:10.650
I need a little more time—

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.930
Hurry up. There will be more coming soon.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.690
Did you kill them?

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:18.740
No. They are useful.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.640
Rukino Saki. Renbokoji Akira.

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:25.180
Take control of them and infiltrate the Dorssian army.

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:29.040
It's time. We're going ahead!

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.200
Stick to the plan.

00:13:30.550 --> 00:13:32.700
Will do! See you up there!

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:39.850
There should be a record of the monitor feed in the cockpit.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.780
Then I'll know for sure if I was imagining things or not.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:45.470
Long time no see!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.510
You're Marie, right? Right?

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:52.270
How do you know my name?

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:55.690
I know you! It's Pino, Marie. Your friend.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.940
Friend?

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.590
But you're...

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:01.630
This isn't my real form.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.520
But we really are friends!

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.530
Have been for five years!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:05.900
Five years?!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:08.910
Yeah! Friends! Friends!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:23.800
<i>Your job is to lure the enemy to this hill.</i>

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:27.640
Once that's done, we'll collapse the ground beneath them with bombs.

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:30.210
We're blowing those caves up, then?

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:31.430
Renbokoji Akira.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.140
You'll use that time to infiltrate the Dorssian army

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:36.390
and hijack a transport vessel from the inside.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.690
You're not alone.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:49.660
I... I... Yeah...

00:14:55.250 --> 00:15:00.900
Have any of you spotted any irregulars in the area between 0300 and now?

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:05.960
I confronted intruders on the north hill.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:09.000
Two males and a female in their late teens.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.050
Two of them sounded like JIORians.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:15.370
True to your Karlstein upbringing.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:16.990
Can you take us there?

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.560
We're all heading in the north.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.850
Blitzendegen!

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.100
<i>They bit!</i>

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:25.240
Wait. Let us join as well.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:29.150
Say, was one of them silver-haired?

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.660
<i>These two are L-Elf's comrades.</i>

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.940
Excuse me, but—

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:34.070
I know.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.060
We will be strictly observing.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.520
All martial authority rests with you.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:39.830
I understand.

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:45.790
He's got silver hair and this really mean look in his eyes.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.480
I don't believe he was there.

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.760
Too bad.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.390
I guess they must be the students then.

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:52.550
Most likely.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.560
Those questions fall under our purview—

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:55.960
Fine, fine.

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:02.890
Do you remember what happened to me five years ago?

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:04.560
Did we meet?

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:09.770
It's me, Pino. Do you have amnesia? You don't remember?

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:14.470
I don't. My memories only go back two years.

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:18.280
Tell me! Did you know me back then?

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:22.040
Oh right... It's because I ate the runes.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.440
Ate? Or ingest?

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:27.260
Sorry, I'm bad with words again.

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:29.170
They reset the system.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:33.210
What are you talking about? Aren't you just an OS?

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:36.790
Marie...

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.220
This body is amazing.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.840
This is Renbokoji. We are in position.

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:13.840
Very well. Commence operation.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.220
Unit 3, do you copy?

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.300
Hell yeah!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.850
The goal is to take the Blume down. Go!

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.480
Roger that!

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.540
I'm not gonna hesitate!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:26.960
Enemy incoming!

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:37.450
From the sea?

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:38.980
<i>It's begun.</i>

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.720
Holy shit, that firepower!

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.220
Flying around so much's killing my temperature!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.410
The strongest weapon of the Dorssian ground forces, the Idealblume.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.230
However...

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.070
They were hiding another one?

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:32.340
What?!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:40.200
The Blume's firepower is unparalleled against land combat weapons with thin top armor plating.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:43.100
Unit 5 can focus its defensive capabilities overhead.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:48.020
It's unstoppable! How can it possess such strong defenses?!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:50.300
It's time! Let's use it!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:00.250
Farewell, Idealblume.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:04.200
In a world where Valvraves exist, you are but a relic of the past.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.210
We did it! Haruto's up next.

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:19.910
It's his turn.

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:24.300
Wait, what? Where's Haruto? Was I wrong?

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.790
No... He's not coming!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:27.600
L-Elf!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:30.170
Tokishima Haruto, what are you doing?!

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:32.950
Marie...

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:35.590
You talked...

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.610
...with the Valvrave?

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.380
Stop.

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:43.490
Haruto, what are you?

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:47.490
What are you talking about? I'm—

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.010
I saw it.

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:53.000
Your right eye was wounded when entering the atmosphere, but it healed.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:55.630
Marie?

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:57.660
I wasn't mistaken.

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:02.010
Your eye was healed by the time we landed.

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:14.440
Mission complete!

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:17.230
We did it!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.850
You and me were more than enough for the job!

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.450
Fighters?

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:25.580
I've never seen anything like them.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.960
They all look the same once you shoot 'em down.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.650
Output at 20%.

00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:34.400
Thermal emissions nominal.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:35.760
Phase three clear.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:38.090
Proceeding to test phase four.

00:20:39.140 --> 00:20:40.700
Let me ask again.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:44.340
Haruto, what are you?

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:47.850
Tell me.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:56.610
I'm... not human.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:20:59.610
Not human?

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:01.400
That's right.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:06.620
Tell me everything. That includes the Valvraves.

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:14.870
When Dorssia attacked Module 77, I...

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:30.760
Marie!

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:33.560
Get in the Valvrave, Tokishima Haruto.

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:35.390
The fighting has already begun.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:37.400
Follow the plan.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:38.890
L-Elf!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:42.900
Kirschbaum, output at destroyer level.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.050
Acknowledged, Kirschbaum.

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.710
Careful! We don't have any intel on these!

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:01.750
Who gives a shit?!

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:13.100
Yamada!

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:19.130
Why did you shoot Marie?!

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:22.610
If the truth about your holy spirit leaked out, we would no longer be able to maintain this combat group.

00:22:22.970 --> 00:22:26.490
Screw you! Your answer to everything is always violence!

00:22:34.310 --> 00:22:35.620
Impossible...

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:15.390
PREVIEW

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:18.410
Next time, episode 16: Marie released.

00:24:19.270 --> 00:24:24.480
Valvrave the Liberator... The system that unveils the world.

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:27.480
EPISODE 16

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:27.480
Marie Released
